# 🛡️ PhishGuard - Phishing Awareness Program

## 📌 Project Overview

PhishGuard is a cybersecurity awareness website designed to
educate users about phishing attacks and online scams.

It helps users understand common phishing techniques, identify
suspicious messages, and learn essential online safety practices.

This project was developed as an educational project for the
CodSoft Cyber Security Internship.

## 🎯 Objectives

- Educate users about phishing attacks.
- Explain common types of phishing.
- Identify common warning signs in suspicious messages.
- Promote safe online browsing habits.
- Test users' cybersecurity knowledge through an interactive quiz.

## ✨ Features

### 1. Educational Dashboard
Introduces phishing and explains its importance.

### 2. Types of Phishing
Explains email phishing, smishing, spear phishing, and fake websites.

### 3. Suspicious Message Checker
Checks message text for selected phishing warning signs.

### 4. Cyber Safety Tips
Provides practical recommendations for safer online behavior.

### 5. Interactive Quiz
Contains five multiple-choice questions with immediate feedback
and a final score.

### 6. Responsive Design
Uses CSS media queries to support different screen sizes.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

## 📁 Project Structure

```text
